WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.053 --> 00:00:08.227
The sun came up.

2
00:00:08.228 --> 00:00:17.699
The friends were still arguing!

3
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:20.879
Berry went over to them.

4
00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:27.682
"You didn't go to bed?" he asked.

5
00:00:27.683 --> 00:00:30.517
Cupcake rubbed her eyes.

6
00:00:30.518 --> 00:00:36.498
"We weren't tired."

7
00:00:36.499 --> 00:00:39.522
Pickle yawned.

8
00:00:39.523 --> 00:00:46.111
"Let's start the big contest."

9
00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:49.648
Bok Choy was the referee.

10
00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:55.248
"First it's jumping time," he said.

11
00:00:55.249 --> 00:01:02.901
Berry jumped over all the forks.

12
00:01:02.902 --> 00:01:15.476
Pickle only jumped over one. "Hmph!"

13
00:01:15.477 --> 00:01:24.187
"Oof!" Popcorn tripped on a fork.

14
00:01:24.188 --> 00:01:34.548
Cupcake landed on her face. "Ouch!"

15
00:01:34.549 --> 00:01:50.508
Noodles didn't even try.

16
00:01:50.509 --> 00:01:59.244
"Berry won at jumping," Bok Choy said.

17
00:01:59.245 --> 00:02:03.190
"Now it's race time.

18
00:02:03.191 --> 00:02:10.188
One, two, three . . . Go!"

19
00:02:10.189 --> 00:02:16.106
Berry took off fast!

20
00:02:16.107 --> 00:02:25.307
"Yikes!" Popcorn tripped.

21
00:02:25.308 --> 00:02:32.692
Noodles walked.

22
00:02:32.693 --> 00:02:46.011
Cupcake and Pickle crashed into each other.

23
00:02:46.012 --> 00:03:05.086
"Berry won the big contest," Bok Choy said.

24
00:03:05.087 --> 00:03:10.927
Cupcake yawned. "Good job, Berry."

25
00:03:10.928 --> 00:03:20.938
Berry shrugged. "I'm just having fun!"

